port R_PSG_1: C64.1 R133.2  # in MAME: not a part: a 1K from +5V standing in for one output of the sound chip (PSG) MAME emulates separately; on the sheet U30's three outputs (pins 1, 4, 5) are tied straight onto R133(R_PSG_1), not a part: a 1K from +5V standing in for one output of the sound chip (PSG) MAME emulates separately; on the sheet U30's three outputs (pins 1, 4, 5) are tied straight onto R133(R_PSG_2), not a part: a 1K from +5V standing in for one output of the sound chip (PSG) MAME emulates separately; on the sheet U30's three outputs (pins 1, 4, 5) are tied straight onto R133(R_PSG_3)
